{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cameraLookingAtCenterCoordinate:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D","text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"centerCoordinate"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"altitude:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDistance","text":"CLLocationDistance"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"altitude"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pitch:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CGFloat","text":"CGFloat"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"pitch"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"heading:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDirection","text":"CLLocationDirection"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"heading"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The geographic coordinate on which the map should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"centerCoordinate"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The altitude (measured in meters) above the map at which the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"camera should be situated. The altitude may be less than the distance from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the camera’s viewpoint to the camera’s focus point."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"altitude"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The viewing angle of the camera, measured in degrees. A value of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" results in a camera pointed straight down at the map. Angles greater"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" result in a camera angled toward the horizon."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"pitch"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The camera’s heading, measured in degrees clockwise from true"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"north. A value of "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means that the top edge of the map view corresponds to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"true north. The value "},{"code":"90","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means the top of the map is pointing due east."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The value "},{"code":"180","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means the top of the map points due south, and so on."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"heading"}],"kind":"parameters"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapcamera\/cameralookingatcentercoordinate:altitude:pitch:heading:"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a new camera with the given altitude, pitch, and heading."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapCamera"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cameraLookingAtCenterCoordinate:altitude:pitch:heading:"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapCamera(cm)cameraLookingAtCenterCoordinate:altitude:pitch:heading:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cameraLookingAtCenterCoordinat